WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.492
Just had extensions or a lash lift? The first few days decide how long your lashes stay beautiful!

2
00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:13.173
Remember three things: don't rub your eyes, keep them dry for 24 hours, and come back on time.

3
00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:17.841
First: don't rub your eyes, and don't pull or pick at your lashes.

4
00:00:17.841 --> 00:00:23.481
Rubbing makes extensions twist and fall out, and takes your natural lashes with them.

5
00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:29.008
Second: keep your lashes dry for 24 hours, and skip the sauna and steam.

6
00:00:29.008 --> 00:00:35.025
The glue and the lifting solution need time to set, and water too soon shortens the result.

7
00:00:35.025 --> 00:00:39.189
Third: get your extensions refilled every two to three weeks.

8
00:00:39.189 --> 00:00:44.221
Redo a lash lift every six to eight weeks, once new lashes have grown in.

9
00:00:44.221 --> 00:00:52.075
In short: don't rub, keep them dry for 24 hours, and come back on time, and your lashes will stay beautiful.

10
00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:55.987
Questions about lash care? Moja Beauty is happy to help!

11
00:00:55.987 --> 00:01:02.341
